B.ahE={[u.p]:0,[u.q]:1,[u.Q]:2,"Porta le gambe in posizione di allungamento. Mantieni 20-30 secondi.":3,[u.N]:4,[u.jO]:5,[u.ak]:6,[u.z]:7,[u.a8]:8,[u.cR]:9,[u.i]:10,[u.Y]:11,[u.E]:12,[u.V]:13,[u.jB]:14,[u.al]:15,"Esegui il movimento con controllo. Mantieni il core stabile.":16,"Esegui il movimento esplosivo verso l'alto. Controlla la discesa.":17,"Mantieni il core stabile durante l'esercizio.":18,[u.e]:19,"Non arrotondare la schiena. Mantieni il core contratto.":20,"Non usare lo slancio. Concentrati sull'isolamento dei muscoli target.":21}
B.yC=new A.O(B.ahE,["Perform the movement slowly and under control. Maintain correct posture.","Start with moderate weight to master the technique.","Bring your arms into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.","Bring your legs into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.",u.nA,"Bring your leg into the stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.","Move into the calf stretch position and hold for 20-30 seconds.","Breathe deeply. Never force beyond your natural range.","Breathe deeply. Do not force beyond your limit.","Breathe deeply. Do not push beyond your comfort limit.","Do not push beyond your comfort limit. Breathe deeply.","Do not pull on your neck. Breathe normally.","Do not pull on your neck. Focus on contracting your abs.","Keep your core engaged throughout the exercise. Control the eccentric phase.","Focus on squeezing your glutes and keep your core stable.",u.nY,"Perform the movement under control and keep your core stable.","Drive the movement explosively upward and control the lowering phase.","Keep your core stable throughout the exercise.","Avoid swinging. Control both the upward and downward phases.","Do not round your back. Keep your core braced.","Do not use momentum. Focus on isolating the target muscles."],t.l)
